<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47542" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤρεμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, later
		form for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρεμαῖος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quiet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤ. καὶ ἡσύχιος βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Ti.</u>
					2.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				519.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.536
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. πούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Trag.</u>
					207
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤρεμον ἑαυτὸν παρέχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IPE</u>
					12.40.24
				</span></i>
			 (Olbia, <span class="entity">ii/iii A.D.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος ἐπισπασμός</span>
			<i>gentler</i> traction, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.73
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἤ</span>. <i>smoothness</i>, of
			pigments, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>
			<i>quietly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Asp.
				<u>in EN</u>
				120.13
			</span></i>. (Cf. Lith. <i>rìmti</i> 'grow still', Goth.
				<i>rimis</i> (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡσυχία</span>),
			Skt. <i>ramṇāti</i> 'set at rest'.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
